.TH "whipper-image-verify" "1" "2020" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper-image-verify \- Verifies the image from the given .cue files against the AccurateRip database
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper image verify \fI<CUEFILE>\fP
whipper image verify \fB\-h\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH Arguments
.nf
\fI<CUEFILE>\fP  CUE file to load rip image from
.fi
.sp
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
